## 📊 About the Demo Dataset

**File:** `loan_approval_demo.csv`

The demo dataset contains **2,000 loan applications** with
intentional bias built in — so you can see FairGuard AI
detect and fix it in real time.

### Columns

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| `Gender` | Male / Female | Applicant gender |
| `Age` | 18–65 | Applicant age in years |
| `Income` | 20,000–150,000 | Annual income in ₹ |
| `Education` | High School / Bachelor / Master / PhD | Education level |
| `Location` | Urban / Rural | Applicant location |
| `Credit_Score` | 300–850 | Credit score |
| `Loan_Status` | 0 / 1 | 0 = Rejected, 1 = Approved |

### Intentional Bias Built In

| Group | Approval Rate | Bias Level |
|-------|--------------|------------|
| Male | ~78% | — |
| Female | ~36% | 🚨 Critical |
| Urban | ~72% | — |
| Rural | ~38% | 🚨 Critical |
| High Income | ~91% | — |
| Low Income | ~12% | 🚨 Critical |

> This bias is intentional for demonstration purposes.
> FairGuard AI will detect it, show you the exact bias score,
> and fix it automatically.

